message: "If you use scrapeplanner in research or a publication, please cite it."
title: scrapeplanner
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool that reports the cheapest reliable, polite way to collect
  a website's data: robots.txt and sitemaps, platform, public feeds and APIs,
  structured data, embedded JSON and anti-bot vendor, then a collection plan.
